Hermes patch: browser.guard_local. On a home on a person's own Mac the terminal is off, so the browser is the one tool
that can reach the Mac's files and home network; this makes the local browser refuse file: pages and private addresses.
Base: Hermes 74943bb889. Set by mac/engine/zero_engine.py (render_config). Design: docs/plans/2026-11-21-friend-mac-home.md.

diff --git a/tools/browser_tool_cloud.py b/tools/browser_tool_cloud.py
